Origin: DHI-internal (DHI build harness)
Description: Skip libopenh264-cisco8 when pkg.openh264.nocisco profile is active.
 The Cisco contrib package conflicts with libopenh264-8 and its postinst downloads
 a proprietary binary over HTTP from ciscobinary.openh264.org; DHI ships only the
 DFSG-built libopenh264-8 runtime library.
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI package subset only)
https://salsa.debian.org/debian/openh264/-/blob/debian/2.6.0+dfsg-2/debian/control

--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
  It is suitable for use in real time applications such as WebRTC.
 
 Package: libopenh264-cisco8
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.openh264.nocisco>
 Section: contrib/libs
 Provides: libopenh264-8
 Conflicts: libopenh264-8
